{"id":"665230","name":"玉米面棒棒馍","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/665230/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"200克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"糖","amount":"50克"},{"name":"耐高糖酵母","amount":"5克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"15克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克玉米面➕200克开水烫面。","img":"images/665230/step_1.png"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665230/step_2.png"},{"step":3,"desc":"加50克糖（也可不加）。","img":"images/665230/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入两个鸡蛋，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665230/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入300克面粉。","img":"images/665230/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"克酵母。","img":"images/665230/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"克猪油，搅成大面絮。","img":"images/665230/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再下手揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/665230/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搓成长条，切成小剂子。","img":"images/665230/step_9.png"},{"step":10,"desc":"搓成纺锤状。","img":"images/665230/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入蒸锅，醒发至两倍大（40分钟左右）。","img":"images/665230/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"凉水上锅，大火，出汽后计时蒸12～15分钟，再焖3分钟，就好了。","img":"images/665230/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蓬松暄软。","img":"images/665230/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"组织细腻，成品图来一张。","img":"images/665230/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}